  m_Name: Passage_Act3_7Eleven_Flank
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Assembly-CSharp::SundayLastBreath.Data.StoryPassageData
  passageId: Act3_7Eleven_Flank
  passageTitle: ACT3 7ELEVEN FLANK
  associatedRoomId: seven_eleven_back
  backdropSprite: {fileID: 0}
  keepPreviousBackdrop: 0
  animatedBackdropFrames: []
  animationFPS: 8
  musicAction: 0
  backgroundMusicOrAmbience: {fileID: 0}
  musicVolume: 0.5
  entranceSFX: {fileID: 0}
  sfxVolume: 0.8
  speakerName: 
  storyText: "7-ELEVEN \u2014 BACK STORAGE ROOM FLANK\r\n/* DYNAMIC LEADER CONFIGURATION */"
  narrativeBeats:
  - You silently slide past the overflowing alley dumpster and force open the squeaking rear service door with your blade.
  - Inside the rear storage room, stacks of cardboard boxes provide complete cover. Two scavengers are leaning around the beverage cooler door, spraying gunfire into the front floor.
  - With a coordinated burst of silenced fire, you drop both scavengers before they even realize you're behind them!
  - The heavy walk-in cooler door clicks open. Commander Miller steps out, wiping sweat from his brow, holding a jerrycan of fuel and a shotgun!
  - "7-ELEVEN \u2014 BACK STORAGE ROOM FLANK"
  - You silently slip past the overflowing service dumpster in the alley, jimmying open the rusted metal rear door with fluid ease.
  - Inside the cramped storage room, stacks of cardboard soda flats and paper goods provide deep shadows. Two scavengers lean through the doorway, blindly firing at the walk-in cooler.
  - In two synchronized, muffled shots, you and Reyes neutralize both hostiles before they can even scream!
  - The heavy steel latch of the walk-in cooler clicks loose.  pushes the door open, wiping blood and condensation from their forehead, holding a shotgun and a reinforced container of fuel.
  - '[+60 XP] &bull; [+30 TRUST] &bull; [STEALTH AMBUSH BONUS]'
  - '[+60 XP] [+30 TRUST] [STEALTH BONUS]'
  - /* REWARDS & OBJECTIVE COMPLETION */
  - /* COMPLETE RESCUE OBJECTIVE */
  - "[MISSION COMPLETE] Return to Timberline Sanctuary with the Commander and fuel.\r\n    \r\n        \r\n            \r\n                \r\n                    \r\n                    \r\n                    \r\n                \r\n                [MISSION COMPLETE] Secure the fuel canisters and escort the Sanctuary Leader back to base."
  dialogueLines:
  - introNarration: 
    speakerName: Reyes (Whispering)
    side: 1
    avatarSprite: {fileID: 21300000, guid: fafca2e534bf20aa39a4a695c872da2d, type: 3}
    animatedAvatarFrames: []
    avatarFPS: 8
    dialogueText: Perfect ambush angle. On my mark, take out the guy on the left!
    outroNarration: 
    requiresStoryFlag: 
    requiresNotFlag: 
  - introNarration: 
    speakerName: Commander Miller
    side: 1
    avatarSprite: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 75ddbd3fc3b3df6ee8d282c35e71fe95, type: 3}
    animatedAvatarFrames: []
    avatarFPS: 8
    dialogueText: Flawless flank. You caught those bastards completely off guard!
    outroNarration: 
    requiresStoryFlag: 
    requiresNotFlag: 
  - introNarration: 
    speakerName: Commander Miller
    side: 1
    avatarSprite: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 75ddbd3fc3b3df6ee8d282c35e71fe95, type: 3}
    animatedAvatarFrames: []
    avatarFPS: 8
    dialogueText: Evelyn told me you got to Timberline late after sunrise. You operate like a seasoned scout.
    outroNarration: 
    requiresStoryFlag: 
    requiresNotFlag: 
  - introNarration: 
    speakerName: Commander Miller
    side: 1
    avatarSprite: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 75ddbd3fc3b3df6ee8d282c35e71fe95, type: 3}
    animatedAvatarFrames: []
    avatarFPS: 8
    dialogueText: Evelyn told me you slipped into base early before the morning storm. Tactical precision at its finest.
    outroNarration: 
    requiresStoryFlag: 
    requiresNotFlag: 
  - introNarration: 
    speakerName: Reyes (Whispering)
    side: 1
    avatarSprite: {fileID: 21300000, guid: fafca2e534bf20aa39a4a695c872da2d, type: 3}
    animatedAvatarFrames: []
    avatarFPS: 8
    dialogueText: Flawless approach. On my mark, drop the shooter near the ice machine!
    outroNarration: 
    requiresStoryFlag: 
    requiresNotFlag: 
  - introNarration: 
    speakerName: Dad
    side: 1
    avatarSprite: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 55a158dea642682c29a4feceded6d2cc, type: 3}
    animatedAvatarFrames: []
    avatarFPS: 8
    dialogueText: $firstName?! Holy Christ... you took them from behind without a sound! Your mother told me you made it to Timberline... you're both alive!
    outroNarration: 
    requiresStoryFlag: 
    requiresNotFlag: 
  - introNarration: 
    speakerName: Commander Hayes
    side: 1
    avatarSprite: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 303440381b4c9b01134bffd26dd5e479, type: 3}
    animatedAvatarFrames: []
    avatarFPS: 8
    dialogueText: Flawless flank. You caught those scavengers completely off guard, $firstName. Masterclass in silent tactical clearance.
    outroNarration: 
    requiresStoryFlag: 
    requiresNotFlag: 
